    "text": "KFDA\nwebsite\nCanyon\nNight at PPHM with a Glow set for this Friday\nBy Kristin Rodin,\n15 hours agoCANYON, Texas (KFDA) - Panhandle-Plains Historical Museum is inviting the community to its Night at PPHM event Friday with a new twist. Event organizers say Friday’s event will feature glow-in-the-dark fun outside with art, face painting, games, and more. Food and drinks will be available to buy from Tank’s...",
